  "title": "Rhythm Foundry",
  "rules": [
    "Carry one physical lot. Ore and flux are finite; the north and south furnaces hold one of each.",
    "Fire requires ore. A new charge waits two later transitions before reaching cooling or slag.",
    "A flux-complete hot lot has a two-transition quench window. Quenching spends furnace water; expiry makes slag.",
    "Take bins only underfoot and completed furnace lots within one cell. Pass to an adjacent empty waiting worker.",
    "Ship goods near the shipping dock; discard unwanted lots near waste. No stock is replenished.",
    "Worker actions and conflicting destinations use cyclic clock-based priority. Old occupied cells block movement.",
    "Every shipment gives a shared bonus and a private order-dependent value. Private orders are visible only in that role's observation.",
    "Scene state is a binding specification only. Actual recorded replay and animation have not been executed."
  ],
